# Wintertodt: the reward you are after against your own rounds, and rounds that end without you.
# Pieces of the pyromancer outfit seen in the bank are kept as yours; the odds and the rounds to
# the rest come from your kept rounds. Leaving the prison mid-round, and logging out mid-round,
# keep the round with no points. Too few warm items is noted from the game's own line.
#
# Facts (OSRS wiki, Wintertodt; Reward Cart; Pyromancer outfit; Warm gloves):
#  - "There is a 1/150 chance to receive a piece of the pyromancer's outfit players have the least
#    of", tried after the phoenix, dragon axe, tome of fire, warm gloves and bruma torch: about 1/152
#  - warm gloves 1/150, tried after the phoenix, dragon axe and tome of fire
#  - "Logging out, or leaving the prison before the end of a round will result in the loss of all
#    points for the current round."
#  - "If the player is not wearing a minimum of four pieces" the game says "You feel the cold wind
#    strike you as you enter; perhaps you should find some warmer clothes."
#  - Pyromancer garb 20704, hood 20708; the prison is map region 6462 (RuneLite's Wintertodt plugin)
# The prison's layout here is schematic.
scene 1580 3930
at 1630 4000
skill FIREMAKING 85
object WINT_BRAZIER_LIT 1622 3998 as brazier
object WINT_ROOTS 1618 3996 as roots
item DRAGON_AXE "Dragon axe"
items WORN DRAGON_AXE 1
items INV TINDERBOX 1
items INV KNIFE 1
items INV HAMMER 1
items BANK PYROMANCER_TOP 1
items BANK PYROMANCER_HOOD 1
# Forty kept rounds of 1,240 points: 3.48 rewards each, 139 in all; 500 ticks each with the wait.
saved wintertodt.kept "1;1767000000000,400,100,1240,s,0;1767000000001,400,100,1240,s,0;1767000000002,400,100,1240,s,0;1767000000003,400,100,1240,s,0;1767000000004,400,100,1240,s,0;1767000000005,400,100,1240,s,0;1767000000006,400,100,1240,s,0;1767000000007,400,100,1240,s,0;1767000000008,400,100,1240,s,0;1767000000009,400,100,1240,s,0;1767000000010,400,100,1240,s,0;1767000000011,400,100,1240,s,0;1767000000012,400,100,1240,s,0;1767000000013,400,100,1240,s,0;1767000000014,400,100,1240,s,0;1767000000015,400,100,1240,s,0;1767000000016,400,100,1240,s,0;1767000000017,400,100,1240,s,0;1767000000018,400,100,1240,s,0;1767000000019,400,100,1240,s,0;1767000000020,400,100,1240,s,0;1767000000021,400,100,1240,s,0;1767000000022,400,100,1240,s,0;1767000000023,400,100,1240,s,0;1767000000024,400,100,1240,s,0;1767000000025,400,100,1240,s,0;1767000000026,400,100,1240,s,0;1767000000027,400,100,1240,s,0;1767000000028,400,100,1240,s,0;1767000000029,400,100,1240,s,0;1767000000030,400,100,1240,s,0;1767000000031,400,100,1240,s,0;1767000000032,400,100,1240,s,0;1767000000033,400,100,1240,s,0;1767000000034,400,100,1240,s,0;1767000000035,400,100,1240,s,0;1767000000036,400,100,1240,s,0;1767000000037,400,100,1240,s,0;1767000000038,400,100,1240,s,0;1767000000039,400,100,1240,s,0"
chat GAMEMESSAGE "You feel the cold wind strike you as you enter; perhaps you should find some warmer clothes."
widget WintStatus.ENERGY_TITLE text "Wintertodt's Energy: 64%"
widget WintStatus.WARMTH_TITLE text "Your Warmth: 88%"
widget WintStatus.POINTS text "Points<br>140"
tick
expect activity = WINTERTODT
# Joined mid-round: not timed.
expect lines.note = "Joined late"
expect lines ~ "Warm clothing TODO"
expect gauge.Warmth = "88/100"
expect saved.wintertodt.owned = "1;GH"
expect goal = "2/4"
expect goal.pieces ~ "Pyromancer garb DONE"
expect goal.pieces ~ "Pyromancer boots TODO"
# Two pieces at 1 in 152: 304 rewards; at 3.48 a round, 88 rounds of 5:00 each.
expect goal.note = "1 in 152 a reward, always the piece you have least of. About 304 rewards for the 2 you lack: 88 rounds, 7h 20m at your pace."
expect goal.pieces ~ "Your 139 rewards kept"
expect stat.Points_an_hour = "15k"
expect stat.Rewards_an_hour = "41.8"

# Warm gloves instead: one item, the chance of it by now over the 139 kept rewards.
wintertodt reward WARM_GLOVES
tick
expect goal = "0/1"
expect goal.note ~ "1 in 150 a reward. About 150 rewards on average: 44 rounds"
expect goal.note ~ "Even odds by 104 rewards"
expect goal.pieces = "Your 139 rewards kept IDLE"

# Out of the prison mid-round: the round's points are lost.
close WintStatus.ENERGY_TITLE
close WintStatus.WARMTH_TITLE
close WintStatus.POINTS
at 1630 3950
tick
expect activity = NONE
expect saved.wintertodt.kept ~ ",0,0,0,l,0"

# Back in for a full round from its start, then a logout mid-round.
at 1630 4000
widget WintStatus.ENERGY_TITLE text "The Wintertodt returns in: 0:10"
tick 17
widget WintStatus.ENERGY_TITLE text "Wintertodt's Energy: 100%"
widget WintStatus.POINTS text "Points<br>0"
tick 20
expect lines.note = "0:11"
expect step = "Chop bruma roots"
# No warmth title read: the warmth varbit, 0 to 1000 (RuneLite's status bars divide it by 10).
varbit WINT_WARMTH 725
tick
expect gauge.Warmth = "72/100"
widget WintStatus.POINTS text "Points<br>260"
tick
state LOGIN_SCREEN
tick
# The first left round is no longer the last; the logged-out one is timed, its points still lost.
expect saved.wintertodt.kept ~ ",0,0,0,l,0;"
expect saved.wintertodt.kept ~ ",17,0,l,0"
